{"sha": "52d92eabb1ebfc23abef6f18ca578fe731004d9718adda47bab47e91f326330a", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:product} 章 --- 乘积测度，", "富比尼、变量代换}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:1}", "$\\Delta$ 在 $\\intcc01^2$ 中是闭集，因而是博雷尔集，且 $\\mathcal", "B(\\intcc01^2)$ 是乘积 $\\sigma$-代数", "（\\cref{prop:b3:product:sections}(b)）。按一种次序累次积分：", "\\[", "\\int_{\\intcc01}\\Bigl(\\int \\mathbf 1_\\Delta(x,y)", "\\,\\dd\\lambda(y)\\Bigr)\\dd\\mu(x)", "= \\int \\lambda(\\{x\\})\\,\\dd\\mu(x) = 0 ;", "\\]", "另一种次序：", "\\[", "\\int_{\\intcc01}\\Bigl(\\int\\mathbf", "1_\\Delta(x,y)\\,\\dd\\mu(x)\\Bigr)\\dd\\lambda(y)", "= \\int \\mu(\\{y\\})\\,\\dd\\lambda(y) = \\int 1\\,\\dd\\lambda = 1 .", "\\]", "失效的假设是 $\\sigma$-有限性：计数测度 $\\mu$ 在", "不可数集 $\\intcc01$ 上不满足它。", "没有任何由 $\\mu$ 有限的集合构成的可数族能覆盖它。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:2}", "在 $\\intcc0A\\times\\intoo0{+\\infty}$ 上：", "$\\int_0^A\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-xy}\\abs{\\sin x}\\,\\dd y\\,\\dd x =", "\\int_0^A\\frac{\\abs{\\sin x}}x\\dd x \\leq A < \\infty$（托内利定理，对绝对值）", "富比尼定理可用，且由于", "$\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-xy}\\dd y = \\frac1x$，于是", "\\[", "\\int_0^A\\frac{\\sin x}x\\dd x", "= \\int_0^\\infty\\Bigl(\\int_0^A\\eu^{-xy}\\sin x\\,\\dd", "x\\Bigr)\\dd y", "= \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{1 - \\eu^{-Ay}(\\cos A + y\\sin A)}{1 +", "y^2}\\,\\dd y", "\\]", "（内层积分：$\\operatorname{Im}\\int_0^A\\eu^{(\\iu -", "y)x}\\dd x$，直接算出）。当 $A \\to \\infty$ 时，", "修正项的界为 $\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-Ay}\\frac{1 +", "y}{1 + y^2}\\dd y \\leq \\frac32\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-Ay}\\dd y =", "\\frac3{2A} \\to 0$；主项为", "$\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\dd y}{1+y^2} = \\frac\\pi2$。于是", "$\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\sin x}x\\dd x = \\frac\\pi2$ --- 由富比尼定理得出的", "狄利克雷积分。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:3}", "(a) 层饼公式（\\cref{prop:b3:product:layercake}）：$\\int", "f\\,\\dd\\mu = \\int_0^\\infty\\mu(f > t)\\,\\dd t$，且 $t \\mapsto", "\\mu(f > t)$ 为非增函数。在 $[n-1, n]$ 上：$\\mu(f \\geq n)", "\\leq \\mu(f > t) \\leq \\mu(f > n - 1) \\leq \\mu(f \\geq n - 1)$；", "对各单位区间上的积分求和：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\mu(f \\geq n) \\leq \\int f\\,\\dd\\mu \\leq", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\mu(f \\geq n - 1) = \\mu(f \\geq 0) +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\mu(f\\geq n) \\leq \\mu(X) + \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\mu(f\\geq", "n).", "\\]", "", "(b) 对 $\\abs f$ 应用 (a)：积分的有限性与", "级数的有限性等价（多出的 $\\mu(X)$ 有限）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:4}", "由于 $f(x,y) = \\partial_y\\bigl(\\frac{y}{x^2+y^2}\\bigr)$ 在", "$x \\ne 0$ 时成立：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 f(x, y)\\,\\dd y = \\frac{1}{x^2 + 1}", "\\ \\Longrightarrow\\", "\\int_0^1\\!\\!\\int_0^1 f\\,\\dd y\\,\\dd x =", "\\int_0^1\\frac{\\dd x}{1 + x^2} = \\frac\\pi4 ;", "\\]", "由反对称性 $f(y,x) = -f(x,y)$，另一种次序给出", "$-\\frac\\pi4$。取绝对值，对 $0 < y < x$，", "\\[", "\\int_0^x f(x,y)\\,\\dd y = \\Bigl[\\frac{y}{x^2 +", "y^2}\\Bigr]_0^x = \\frac1{2x},", "\\quad\\text{且 } f \\geq 0 \\text{ 在该处，因此}\\quad", "\\int_0^1\\!\\!\\int_0^1\\abs f \\geq \\int_0^1\\frac{\\dd x}{2x} =", "+\\infty .", "\\]", "与富比尼定理并不矛盾：其假设 $f \\in L^1$", "不成立，两个累次积分恰好是两个不同的", "数值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:5}", "(a) $(\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc01}*\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc01})(x) =", "\\lambda\\bigl(\\intcc01\\cap\\intcc{x-1}x\\bigr)$：$0$，当 $x", "\\notin \\intcc02$ 时；$x$，当 $0 \\leq x \\leq 1$ 时；$2 - x$，当 $1", "\\leq x \\leq 2$：帐篷函数。再卷积一次，得到 $\\mathcal", "C^1$ 的分段二次凸峰，位于 $\\intcc03$ 上（二次", "B 样条）：每次卷积使光滑度提高一级 ---", "光滑化原理，正是 \\cref{ch:b3:lp} 中磨光子的依据。", "", "(b) 若 $x \\notin \\overline{\\operatorname{supp}f +", "\\operatorname{supp}g}$，则存在围绕 $x$ 的一个球，", "与和集不相交；对 $y \\in \\operatorname{supp}g$，$x - y", "\\notin\\operatorname{supp}f$，故被积函数", "恒等于零：$f * g = 0$ 在 $x$ 附近。", "", "(c) 对 $x_n \\to x$：$(f*g)(x_n) = \\int", "f(y)g(x_n - y)\\,\\dd y$；被积函数逐点收敛", "（由 $g$ 的连续性），并被 $\\norm", "g_\\infty\\,\\abs f \\in L^1$ 控制：由控制收敛定理，$(f*g)(x_n) \\to (f*g)(x)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:6}", "(a) 由富比尼定理与归纳法，沿最后一个", "坐标切片：", "\\[", "\\lambda_d(\\Delta_d) = \\int_0^1", "\\lambda_{d-1}\\bigl((1 - t)\\,\\Delta_{d-1}\\bigr)\\,\\dd t", "= \\lambda_{d-1}(\\Delta_{d-1})\\int_0^1(1 - t)^{d-1}\\dd t", "= \\frac{\\lambda_{d-1}(\\Delta_{d-1})}{d},", "\\]", "利用伸缩性质 $\\lambda_{d-1}(\\rho A) =", "\\rho^{d-1}\\lambda_{d-1}(A)$", "（见\\cref{thm:b3:product:linearchange}）；", "取 $\\lambda_1(\\Delta_1) = 1$，得体积 $\\frac1{d!}$。", ""]}